{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32372","headline":"春尽与友人入裴氏林探渔竿 · 温庭筠","name":"春尽与友人入裴氏林探渔竿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一迳互纡直，茅棘亦已繁。\n晴阳入荒竹，暧暧如春园。\n倚杖息惭倦，徘徊恋微暄。\n历寻婵娟节，翦破苍筤根。\n地闭修茎孤，林振余箨翻。\n适心在所好，非必寻湘沅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}